  {
   "id": 239019,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/0b3f4cd3b60773d3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by lineage, StackExchange)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>A tuning fork is an instrument that produces a note (sound) with a specific frequency. The image shows a stationary and a vibrating tuning fork.</p>\n<p>Make a claim about the nature of sound waves produced by the fork.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 745762,
     "content_html": "They are transverse."
    },
    {
     "id": 745763,
     "content_html": "They are longitudinal."
    },
    {
     "id": 745761,
     "content_html": "They are both transverse and longitudinal."
    },
    {
     "id": 745760,
     "content_html": "They are neither transverse nor longitudinal."
    }
   ],
